WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Pipeline is the same deals in stages. Drag only when the file actually moved.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Funders is the roster the matcher uses. Harbor Advance and Northstar Capital are examples.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:34.000
New deal is a manual file. Open a deal, pick funders from the ranked match, then submit. The app never auto-submits.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Settings → Setup replays shop setup and this tour.
